  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency livelihood assistance to safeguard food and nutrition security, sustain income and local production of most vulnerable rural families affected my multiple shocks in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to provide urgent and season-sensitive agriculture inputs to 15 875 food-insecure, vulnerable, smallholder and landless households (111 125 people) to mitigate the adverse impacts of multiple recent shocks as well as enhancing their food nutrition security and near-term resilience.</narrative>
